# EXPECT: this function is observed
# (#218) The OBSERVED member of the class: the function observes `z` itself
# (a predicate), so Part 2a keys its locals into the global env BY NAME --
# where the module `z` already lives. The VM gives the frame binding its own
# observer slot (converged 0, prev 0.25, module 1); the per-call env (Part
# 2b) is what lifts this, so it stays a loud by-name refusal.
z is 1.0
define u() as:
    z is 0.25
    z is 0.5
    print of (converged of z)
    return prev of z
print of (u of [])
print of z
